128 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (A Hackathon is an event which, contrary to the name, does NOT involve hacking. Rather, it is a high-energy, collaborative event in which students work together to solve a problem given in the form of a prompt, usually within a timespan of 24 - 48 hours. They are challenged with coming up with a comprehensive solution, creating a prototype, and pitching in front of judges. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
